# Generated figures — every PNG here is rebuilt by the notebooks from data/processed/,
# so a clone regenerates them rather than carrying them. Same policy as the metagenome
# repo's results/ directory.
figures/

# Large/raw download content.
#
# WARNING: per DOWNLOADS.md these are MANUAL, CAPTCHA-gated downloads that no script can
# fetch. Because they are untracked, data/interim/ and data/processed/ are the only
# reproducible starting point in this repo and are deliberately KEPT under version
# control — do not "clean them up" by ignoring them, or a fresh clone can regenerate
# nothing.
data/raw/

# data/manual/ is TRACKED — it holds inputs no code can regenerate. Currently the HHpred
# queries and .hhr results, run by hand on the MPI Bioinformatics Toolkit web server
# (no REST API exists for HHpred). Re-running them against a newer PDB70/Pfam would give
# different probabilities, so they are evidence, not build artifacts. Put any other
# hand-downloaded input here rather than in data/interim/.

# Slides and talk material — not part of the analysis
JournalClub.pdf

